         "m_IsVisible": true,
         "m_Speed": 40.0,
         "m_TextContent": "3) Entertainment! The grandest party is incomplete without\nmusic, bring something entertaining for everyone!"
      },
      2097296,
      {
         "m_Color": [
            0.15830117464065552,
            0.04828491806983948,
            0.04828491806983948,
            1.0
         ],
         "m_FadingSpeed": 0.0,
         "m_FontType": "JuaRegular",
         "m_IsDialogue": false,
         "m_IsFading": false,
         "m_IsVisible": true,
         "m_Speed": 50.0,
         "m_TextContent": "Dear Holey & Moley,\n\nGood tidings, mole brethren! I'm holding the grandest of parties at the town\nsquare, but this party is no ordinary one! 'Tis is a party only for the\nmost deserving, the most dapper, the most party-centric of mole society!\n\nShould you accept the invitation, there are standards to be met."
      },
      2097308,
      {
         "m_Color": [
            0.1568627506494522,
            0.0470588244497776,
            0.0470588244497776,
            1.0
         ],
         "m_FadingSpeed": 0.0,
         "m_FontType": "JuaRegular",
         "m_IsDialogue": false,
         "m_IsFading": false,
         "m_IsVisible": true,
         "m_Speed": 40.0,
         "m_TextContent": "Ready to have the grandest time of your lives?\nThen see you there!\n\nYours Sincerely,\nNolan the Golden"
      },
      2097304,
      {
         "m_Color": [
            0.1568627506494522,
            0.0470588244497776,
            0.0470588244497776,
            1.0
         ],
         "m_FadingSpeed": 0.0,
         "m_FontType": "JuaRegular",
         "m_IsDialogue": false,
         "m_IsFading": false,
         "m_IsVisible": true,
         "m_Speed": 40.0,
         "m_TextContent": "2) I expect fashion of the highest calibre. We have a fiesta\ntheme going so stick to it!"
      },
      2097313,
      {
         "m_Color": [
            0.1568627506494522,
            0.0470588244497776,
